# 4. Install missing ROS 2 tools

Some tools might not be included in the Docker image.

Inside Docker:

```bash
apt update
```

Install useful debugging tools:

```bash
apt install -y \
  ros-jazzy-rqt \
  ros-jazzy-rqt-graph \
  ros-jazzy-rqt-tf-tree \
  ros-jazzy-tf2-tools \
  ros-jazzy-teleop-twist-keyboard \
  ros-jazzy-ros2controlcli \
  iputils-ping \
  net-tools
```

Because your container is persistent, these installations remain available when you stop and restart it.

However, deleting and recreating the container removes installed packages. Files in `/data` remain on your laptop.

